    "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/647a80504bd505f608d560a67466a03a.avif?t=1689229839\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/12de4e8aff83df748fe72af02015c3be.poster.avif?t=1689229839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/12de4e8aff83df748fe72af02015c3be.webm?t=1689229839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/12de4e8aff83df748fe72af02015c3be.mp4?t=1689229839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u201cThe school\u2019s like hell... It\u2019s actually run by devils?!\u201d</h2><br>Black Academy. An institution that forces its students to work.<br>Unfair treatment by seniors, overtime every day.<br>On top of that, teachers have private errands for students!<br><br>The students were inspired by the magical world and became magical girls. Will they put an end to the devils\u2019 plan and clock out?<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/e558678595882a86ed541b921b44be58.avif?t=1689229839\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2726 Side-scrolling shooter + roguelite</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/566ed000b3f190a03dbaeb83df55199a.poster.avif?t=1689229839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/566ed000b3f190a03dbaeb83df55199a.webm?t=1689229839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/566ed000b3f190a03dbaeb83df55199a.mp4?t=1689229839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In Black Academy, collect various spells on different maps and level up in order to slay devils!<br>Exciting horizontal shooter &amp; roguelite game<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2726 Unique attacks by the magical girls!</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/42618e1cb27e865efd1bc6162db21cb0.poster.avif?t=1689229839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/42618e1cb27e865efd1bc6162db21cb0.webm?t=1689229839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/42618e1cb27e865efd1bc6162db21cb0.mp4?t=1689229839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Explore the maps to get various spells.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/deaf710f079ce7bd814b15bc2f00a0df.poster.avif?t=1689229839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/deaf710f079ce7bd814b15bc2f00a0df.webm?t=1689229839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/deaf710f079ce7bd814b15bc2f00a0df.mp4?t=1689229839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Choose a spell that matches your play style.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2726 Magical spells get stronger and stronger!</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/419af7c0d69cfe095339d326b0c521ba.poster.avif?t=1689229839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/419af7c0d69cfe095339d326b0c521ba.webm?t=1689229839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/419af7c0d69cfe095339d326b0c521ba.mp4?t=1689229839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Get power-up items to change magical spells into different shapes and forms.<br>Find new magical spells and check out how they level up.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2726 Cute magical world residents!</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/a99c4d649fa6cbcf0f229d86097fd337.poster.avif?t=1689229839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/a99c4d649fa6cbcf0f229d86097fd337.webm?t=1689229839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/a99c4d649fa6cbcf0f229d86097fd337.mp4?t=1689229839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Each resident has a story and came into the devils\u2019 barrier.<br>They\u2019re a bit stubborn, but they\u2019ll help you clock out.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2726 Blame the overtime on the powerful devils!</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/cc3e9a53782a2e3e2955c9049017df80.poster.avif?t=1689229839\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/cc3e9a53782a2e3e2955c9049017df80.webm?t=1689229839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1602390/extras/cc3e9a53782a2e3e2955c9049017df80.mp4?t=1689229839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Devils live by consuming the dark emotions created by work.<br>They try to use the most powerful stress to rule the world.<br>Get the devils\u2019 attacks under control and step closer to clocking out.",
